WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:43.450
Nothing like the peaceful countryside!

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:49.170
The air tastes good, too.
Going by car was the right choice!

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:51.180
What are you saying?

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:56.380
We were forced to hitchhike after
missing our train, all because <i>you </i>overslept!

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:58.250
Oh, is that right?

00:01:58.250 --> 00:01:59.900
Don't play dumb, now.

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:01.900
You're way too <i>loose</i>, Takao.

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:04.510
Well, whatever.

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:09.200
We met a kind old man, and we're
safely on our way, so it's all good.

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:09.900
Right?

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:12.550
Yup.

00:02:12.550 --> 00:02:18.040
You've come to a place of tranquility,
so fret not about your time constraints.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:19.190
Ya see?

00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:21.700
Jeez, what am I gonna do with you?

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:25.050
Look, boys. The city is coming into sight.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:36.100
Wow, so that's Rome!

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:41.100
Duel at the <i>Colosseo</i>!

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:48.480
The Tornatore family, you say...

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:52.220
It's around here somewhere.
I'm sure you'll come across it.

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:54.140
The building really stands out.

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:56.990
Alright! And with that, we're done.

00:02:57.970 --> 00:02:59.820
Thanks. You were a big help.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:03.080
No sweat! Really, I should be
thanking you for taking us here.

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:06.340
Well then, we should be on our way.

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:08.960
Be careful, kids!

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:11.570
See ya, old man. And thanks!

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:19.940
It's this way.

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.430
Giancarlo Tornatore...

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:24.960
What kind of guy is he?

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:29.730
Who knows. But we can safely
assume he's a very skilled Sacred Beast user.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:34.940
He's the one who defeated Cadav, making him into the evil Blader he is now.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.360
Right...

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.370
I'm getting anxious.

00:03:40.140 --> 00:03:43.100
What's that? No point in worrying now!

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:46.270
The stronger the opponent,
the more meaningful the fight!

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:47.500
Let's take it easy.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:48.820
Good point.

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:50.640
You're right, Takao.

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:53.580
W-What the..?!

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.800
Is this really it?!

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.580
Yes, there's no doubt about it.

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:00.910
Still, this really is...

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:02.520
A super <i>big</i> house!

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:04.590
No, it's more like...

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:07.010
a freaking castle!

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:13.140
Standing around won't accomplish anything.

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:15.450
Let's ring the doorbell.

00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:17.360
Stop!

00:04:18.450 --> 00:04:19.460
And you are..?

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.130
Shhh!

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:23.200
Don't speak so loudly.

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:24.340
Right...

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:27.540
Why are you sneaking around?

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:31.510
Wait! Are you a burglar?! Hold it right there!

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:33.710
<i>Hey, you!</i> Slow down.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:37.590
Me, a burglar? Even as a joke, that isn't funny.

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:39.610
Are you saying we're wrong?

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.220
Of course you are.

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:46.090
If I were a burglar, do you think I
would go out of my way to talk to you?

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:47.960
Ya got a point.

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:51.880
Then are you involved with this mansion in some way?

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.210
Involved?

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:56.110
Hmm... I guess you could say that.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:05:02.330
That's great, then. We're looking for a
boy by the name of Giancarlo that lives here.

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:03.620
Do you know him?

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:08.410
Giancarlo... Yeah, I know him.
What do you need him for?

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:15.120
This! I came here to battle him with my Beyblade!

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:18.390
Beyblade..? What, that's it?

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:20.460
"That's it"?

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.920
Are you making fun of Beyblade?!

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.720
No, nothing of the sort.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:29.440
I just have other things to focus on.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:33.300
Tch. No point in talking to you!

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:36.050
I came here to battle with Giancarlo.

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:39.860
Professor, let's ignore him
and ring the doorbell already.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:40.930
It's pointless.

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:43.650
What makes you say that?

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.460
Because I'm the Giancarlo you're looking for!

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:48.820
What?!

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:53.210
<i>Why?!</i> How come you were acting so secretive?

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:54.740
Isn't this your home?

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:55.790
You see...

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:56.970
Young Master!

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:57.540
Oh crap!

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:01.760
Young Master, what are you doing out here?

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:04.550
Your math instructor will arrive shortly.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:06.410
Well, you see...

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:07.220
See ya!

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:10.020
Young Master, please come back!

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:12.020
Sorry, that won't be possible!

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:12.850
Young Master!

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.440
Wait, Giancarlo! Fight me!

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:20.410
Sorry, but I don't have the time for
that. I have more important things to do.

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:22.400
<i>Ciao!</i>

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:28.660
He's escaped again...

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:31.410
What's his deal?

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:32.680
Yeah...

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:41.560
Now what are we going to do?

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:43.210
Do ya even need to ask?

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:46.520
I'll look for Giancarlo and fight him!

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:50.850
But he didn't look like he wanted to battle at all.

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:51.870
Well...

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:54.980
Even then, we can't stick around for too long.

00:06:55.530 --> 00:07:00.440
We need to get to Russia before the World Tournament begins.

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:03.470
Come on, we've still got plenty of time!

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:04.850
We can stay for a couple of days.

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:08.310
That's only true if all goes as planned.

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:11.080
If you oversleep like you did this morning...

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:13.080
This again?

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:18.790
He's right. If we've no chance to
battle him, it would be wise to give up.

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:20.750
No way...

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:25.360
We can assume that Giancarlo has
mastered the control of his Sacred Beast,

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:28.660
and it's a shame that I can't gather information on him.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:32.900
But if he doesn't feel like fighting,
there's nothing we can do about it.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.760
Takao, a man needs to know when to give up.

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.860
You should really give it up, Kinomiya.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:41.560
Even if you <i>did</i> fight him, you'd probably still lose.

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:42.950
Kai...

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:44.460
What was that?!

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:45.460
The truth.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:48.580
We won't know unless we try!

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:49.780
I wonder...

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:52.820
Don't make fun of me!

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:54.380
That's it!

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:58.580
No matter what you guys tell me, I <i>will</i> fight Giancarlo.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:07:59.380
Takao...

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:02.250
Professor, adjust our schedule.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:04.300
This is crazy talk!

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:06.750
For starters, we don't even know where Giancarlo is.

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:09.220
Come on, I said I'm sorry!

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:10.010
I don't care!

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.120
Wait!

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:12.700
Listen to me!

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:13.710
I won't hear it!

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:15.100
There he is!

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:18.790
Hey! Hey, wait... Wait up! Please!

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:22.820
What happened is, when I was
leaving, some weird guys stopped me and...

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:23.520
I don't care.

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:26.740
Wait! Come back!

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:29.650
Hey, turn that frown upside down.

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:32.760
I'll buy you whatever you like.

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:34.450
You will?

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:40.450
Of course! Coats, bags...
anything from your favourite brands!

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:41.870
Alright!

00:08:42.010 --> 00:08:44.140
That jerk..!

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:45.880
Takao!

00:08:48.350 --> 00:08:51.590
Hey, Giancarlo! You dare call yourself a Beyblader?!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:56.130
Refusing a Bey battle to go around flirting like that..!

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:57.810
Oh, it's you.

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:00.160
You still insist on battling?

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:04.740
You bet! I'm not leaving
Rome until I get to fight with you!

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:07.490
Give it a rest already.

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.430
Thanks to you, I was late for my date,

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:13.940
and now I have to buy presents for these two.

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:15.190
What?

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:16.570
Is that how it is?

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:19.920
You don't like giving us presents?

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:23.880
Oops, I phrased that poorly. My apologies.

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:25.100
Please forgive me.

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:32.500
W-W-What the heck are you doing, you?!
Here I am, trying to have a serious conversation..!

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:33.090
Takao!

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.990
Please, calm yourself.

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:37.290
You shouldn't get hot-headed like this.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.520
I'm so jealous...

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:42.610
Takao!

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.560
But he just kissed her! He kissed!

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:50.200
In the West, a kiss is a form of
greeting. It's nothing to be shocked by.

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:53.550
What? Are you saying you kiss your Dad, Max?

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:55.620
Such a funny guy!

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:59.360
Well, maybe I could introduce you to some girls?

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:01.070
What? For real?!

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:04.840
Takao, why did you come all the way here?

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:06.330
O-Oh, right.

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:08.840
Giancarlo, battle with me!

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:11.520
Yeah? Now you're both happy!

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:13.420
Hey, come back!

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:19.700
I'd rather be having fun with these
girls than getting sweaty in a fight.

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:20.270
<i>Ciao!</i>

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:22.530
That little..!

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:24.350
Takao, what now?

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.980
As expected, he didn't agree to a battle.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:30.270
Tch! That guy isn't even worth fighting.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:35.230
There's no way I'd lose to someone
who would pick girls over Beyblade.

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:36.580
What was that?

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:40.590
Are you saying that I would lose?

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:42.380
Definitely!

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:44.580
How interesting.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:49.140
I would be more than happy to
crush that baseless confidence of yours.

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:51.590
I've yet to hear your name.

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:54.030
It's Takao! Takao Kinomiya!

00:10:54.700 --> 00:11:00.110
Very well, Takao. Giancarlo Tornatore will accept your challenge!

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:07.040
Tomorrow at noon, I'll be waiting in this square.

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:10.880
I'll prepare a battlefield suited to our fight.

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:23.500
W-What the heck is this?!

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:26.430
This thing wasn't here yesterday!

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:28.610
This is... the <i>Colosseo</i>!

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:30.820
Colosseo?

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:33.640
A battle arena from ancient Rome.

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:45.230
Long ago, they could be found all over the Roman
Empire, hosting battles for entertainment's sake.

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:53.910
Do it!

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:04.860
Even now, ruins of these round-shaped structures remain.

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:09.520
Still, it's weird. This thing appeared
out of the blue, and nobody's around...

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:12.260
He might be behind all this.

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:16.760
How amusing. This Giancarlo
guy sure does some flashy things.

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:21.020
A Colosseo, huh... Very well! I'll take you on!

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:31.180
Whoa!

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:33.170
What's going on here?

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:39.730
What is this?!

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:41.230
Takao!

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:44.770
What the heck is this?!

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:48.920
Only those who were chosen
to fight may set foot in the arena.

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:53.920
What's with that outfit?

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:59.690
This is the uniform of the Roman soldier. The
Tornatores are descendants of the Roman Empire.

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:03.260
Such attire is most suited to battle.

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:06.140
This way.

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:10.670
Oh, you guys came, too?

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:14.040
Our friend is fighting down there.
Naturally, we're here to support him.

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:18.790
What's so fun about playing with spinning tops?

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:23.440
I know, right? We were supposed
to go and party on a yacht, too.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:27.880
Still, even when he's fighting, Giancarlo is so sexy!

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:32.720
Let us begin.

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:34.960
Where's the Bey stadium?

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:36.960
Look around you.

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:43.340
This entire arena is our Bey stadium!

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:44.660
What?!

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:49.560
The Colosseo is a sacred arena
where battles to the death took place.

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:54.600
All exits have been shut off, so neither
the Beyblade nor the Blader have a way out.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:59.470
With you fighting here, anything could happen!

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.120
That's what I hoped!

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:06.700
Let me show off my Beyblade, Amphlyon!

00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:10.200
Now I feel bad for that kid..

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:13.460
Nobody can stop Giancarlo when he gets serious.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:19.430
Takao, don't let your guard down!
Giancarlo isn't the same as he was before!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.430
Let's do this!

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:25.200
I'll show you a true warrior's power.

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:29.520
What?!

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:30.730
Could that be..?!

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:36.730
It's Amphilyon's winder, infused with the spirit of the Roman warriors.

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:39.610
Oh, come on. You freaking scared me!

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:43.980
Now, let us begin!

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:44.820
Three!

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:46.700
Two!

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:48.370
One!

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:50.840
Go... Shoot!

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:52.840
Go!

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:00.260
I'll end this quickly.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:02.880
Come, Amphisbaena!

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:12.600
Feast your eyes upon my Sacred Beast, Amphisbaena!

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:15.360
What's that Sacred Beast? A lizard?

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:18.140
Amphisbaena... If I'm correct, that's..!

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:21.340
Amphisbaena, tear him apart!

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:25.490
Dodge it, Dragoon!

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:33.090
Is that all? I can dodge that kind of attack, no sweat!

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:38.210
What's wrong, Giancarlo? You're not even scratching me.

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:41.930
This is strange... His attacks are too telegraphed.

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:44.120
Is this really all Amphilyon can do?

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:45.770
...But it's always weird...

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:50.300
It always seems to me like there's two of Giancarlo's tops.

00:15:58.570 --> 00:15:59.680
Don't tell me..!

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:02.520
You're pretty fast, I'll give you that.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:04.400
What about this, then?

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.170
Twin Destruction!

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:08.490
Too slow!

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:17.370
Takao! It's not over yet!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.920
Look out for Amphisbaena's tail!

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:27.590
Tsk! I only grazed him.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:30.560
What?! There's another head on its tail?!

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:35.480
A Beyblade that appears as two... A two-headed Sacred Beast, Amphisbaena!

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:38.680
As I predicted, the attack comes in two phases.

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:42.560
You got saved by the advice of an outsider.

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.220
You dirtied our sacred battle!

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:45.480
What?!

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:47.640
I've already told you.

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:52.500
The Colosseo is a place for sacred battles.
Interventions from outsiders aren't allowed!

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:59.630
Outsiders?! You've got it all wrong! Even if they're
not standing in the stadium, we can fight as one!

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:02.250
They're fighting with me!

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.210
Foolish...

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:06.270
Takao, time for your comeback!

00:17:06.270 --> 00:17:08.460
Show him Dragoon's attack power!

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:11.170
Right on! Let's go, Giancarlo!

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:15.900
Phantom Hurricane!

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:27.400
Subside, Amphisbaena!

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:40.300
What's the big idea? Don't think I'll hold back now!

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:43.950
Don't you worry. That is not why I'm doing this.

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:50.160
Crushing your opponent with overwhelming strength, guided by a proud leader...

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:54.300
That is the origin of Rome's strength,

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:56.320
as well as my way of fighting.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:18:00.200
I can't allow attacks fueled by blind rage.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:05.070
Oh? He has complete control over his Sacred Beast.

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:08.350
But that alone wouldn't be very fun.

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:13.350
You're a bit too short-tempered.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:16.410
Well, it's fine. I'll let you play for a while.

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:18.360
W-What now?!

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:22.030
Go, Amphisbaena!

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:40.380
This..!

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:46.340
Now freed from Giancarlo's command,
Amphisbaena has regained its base aggression.

00:18:46.340 --> 00:18:47.420
What?!

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:50.880
This is dangerous. We must interrupt the battle.

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:52.990
Takao! Get away from there!

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:56.740
Run, huh..?

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.740
It's a bit late for that now!

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:08.300
Amphisbaena! Your opponent is right here!

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:24.600
Dragoon!

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:28.940
Takao! Get away!

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:44.390
Dragoon..!

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:52.590
His Sacred Beast put his life on the line to protect him...

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:08.570
Dragoon...

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:15.730
Takao...

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:27.730
Hurting other people with your Sacred Beast...

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:30.410
You... You are a..!

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:31.180
Stop it.

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:35.760
It's Kinomiya's fault for not being able to dodge that attack.

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:37.420
A duel is a duel.

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:55.570
Oh no! My clothes are covered in dust!

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:59.180
And now it's raining, too! What are
you going to do about this, Giancarlo?

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:03.680
Sorry, sorry! I'll buy you some new clothes, forgive me!

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:05.200
You will? Alright!

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:08.610
Takao Kinomiya...

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:12.270
Whatever is this feeling of uneasiness..?

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:15.170
Hurry up, Giancarlo! We're getting wet!

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.560
Oh, sorry!

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:17.740
Let's hurry.

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:30.770
Dang it!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:58.660 --> 00:23:02.890
According to my analysis,
Takao wants to fight Giancarlo again.

00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:05.160
That's just how you are.

00:23:05.840 --> 00:23:07.970
What? There's a way to win?

00:23:07.970 --> 00:23:11.940
Amphisbaena is an incredibly
powerful Sacred Beast, you know.

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:16.730
What? The key is the head on the tail's bad temper?

00:23:17.440 --> 00:23:19.850
Next time: Defeat Amphisbaena!

00:23:20.320 --> 00:23:23.170
Oh? Why are <i>vous</i> here, Olivier-kun?
